      "operation": "models.summary",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/models",
      "authentication": "Native HTTPBearer enabled by nonempty api_key, guarded route dependencies; API key and enforcement must be reviewed.",
      "request": "Fixed root /models for original Python infinity_emb 0.0.80 surface; url_prefix must remain empty. No v3 native server or model selection supported.",
      "response": "OpenAIModelInfo response_model adds object=list; each ModelInfo has id string, stats object, object=model and owned_by=infinity. Only model count survives.",
      "scope": [
        "Dedicated operator-reviewed instance. The handler inspects engine configuration and queue status; no embedding/reranking operation called.",
        "No model weights downloaded or used by Verdugo. Model metadata is not a license review of weights, quality assessment or proof that inference succeeds."
      ],
