      "operation": "datasets.summary",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/$/server",
      "authentication": "Original server-wide Jetty Basic authentication with password file and authenticated server policy; operator must explicitly verify that GET /$/server rejects anonymous access. Shiro default has an anonymous exception for this route and is not accepted as protection.",
      "request": "Fixed root /$/server of Fuseki 6.3.0-SNAPSHOT admin module; dedicated instance and empty context path. ASCII username:password in one private environment credential; HTTP Basic Authorization. No query or dataset chosen by params.",
      "response": "ActionServerStatus emits version, startDateTime, integer uptime, datasets; JsonDescription emits ds.name, ds.state bool, ds.services and srv.type/description/endpoints. Only counts survive; no names, endpoints, descriptions, version or timestamps retained.",
      "scope": [
        "The default anonymous status route is rejected by operator review gates. No automatic server reconfiguration, account creation or authorization is performed.",
        "No SPARQL, RDF input, named graphs, inference, writes, model calls or dataset contents. Response snapshot reflects the dedicated server registry, not a complete export or correctness proof.",
        "Original server and its Java dependency closure not installed or executed. HTTP acceptance uses synthetic socket responses."
      ],
